{"vid":"c060vToCC9M","source":"c060vToCC9M.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.6,"txt":"When you're running a stick weld,"},{"t":3.9,"txt":"there's a whole lot to think about, but"},{"t":5.4,"txt":"if you break it down into simple steps,"},{"t":8.4,"txt":"it's really a lot more manageable. Hey,"},{"t":11.2,"txt":"welcome to the shop. Today, I'm going to"},{"t":12.6,"txt":"show you a video that I wish I had when"},{"t":14.9,"txt":"I was getting started with stick"},{"t":16.2,"txt":"welding, and that is breaking a bead"},{"t":18.9,"txt":"down into five different steps and what"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"are the things you need to think about"},{"t":23.7,"txt":"uh as you work through those. Now, this"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"is the big picture video, so I won't go"},{"t":28.2,"txt":"into all of the details of each of these"},{"t":30.5,"txt":"different parts of the weld, but I have"},{"t":32.1,"txt":"them in my online courses and hundreds"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"of videos online. Now, the first step is"},{"t":36.6,"txt":"your setup. And I'm going to select my"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"electrode based on this 1/4 in thick"},{"t":41.5,"txt":"plate that I'll be welding. And so, I'll"},{"t":43.4,"txt":"use a 1/8 in 718. If it's under a/4 in,"},{"t":46.7,"txt":"I use smaller than 1/8. If it's uh over,"},{"t":49.1,"txt":"I pretty much use a 1/8 for everything."},{"t":50.7,"txt":"And I'm using Lincoln Excalibur 718s."},{"t":53.4,"txt":"They're my favorite. There's some light"},{"t":55.3,"txt":"mill scale on this material and these"},{"t":58.2,"txt":"strip discs can clean it off. Now, you"},{"t":60.2,"txt":"don't always have to do this. It's not"},{"t":62.1,"txt":"required even by a lot of codes. Um, but"},{"t":64.9,"txt":"it does make a little bit of a"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"difference in how it runs. Let's just"},{"t":67.5,"txt":"run a little bead, half of it on the"},{"t":70,"txt":"cleaned part and half on the mill scale."},{"t":72.2,"txt":"So, you can see how much of a difference"},{"t":74.1,"txt":"it really makes. And a lot of times I"},{"t":76.7,"txt":"won't uh just cuz it's not worth the"},{"t":78.6,"txt":"time, but it does make a difference in"},{"t":80.4,"txt":"my opinion. So, after I removed the"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"slag, if you look there on the left,"},{"t":84.6,"txt":"it's just tied in a little bit better."},{"t":86.4,"txt":"It's a little smoother than it was"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"running on top of the mill scale. You"},{"t":89.9,"txt":"can have a sound weld either way with or"},{"t":92,"txt":"without this light mill scale when"},{"t":93.5,"txt":"you're stick welding. Um, but it doesn't"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"take too long to remove. So, if"},{"t":96.8,"txt":"something's pretty important to you,"},{"t":98.4,"txt":"it's probably worth the extra effort to"},{"t":100.4,"txt":"clean it off. Now, I'm running the HDP"},{"t":102.2,"txt":"Revolution 2500. This is my favorite"},{"t":104.4,"txt":"welding machine cuz it does pretty much"},{"t":106.3,"txt":"every process and it just works without"},{"t":108.2,"txt":"much messing around. So, I'm putting my"},{"t":110.2,"txt":"electrode holder on positive and"},{"t":112,"txt":"changing it to stick mode. And you just"},{"t":114.5,"txt":"need to select your amperage. With most"},{"t":116.8,"txt":"machines for stick welding, there are"},{"t":118.4,"txt":"some other settings, but they don't make"},{"t":119.6,"txt":"that much of a difference in most cases."},{"t":122.2,"txt":"So, I have my amperage set here. And the"},{"t":125.2,"txt":"next step is the start. And if you've"},{"t":127.1,"txt":"ever experienced that, I'm going to show"},{"t":129.1,"txt":"you how to have it go a little better."},{"t":131.4,"txt":"So, the end of your electrode is bare"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"metal. And you need to touch that to"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"make a little spark. And on a used"},{"t":137,"txt":"electrode, sometimes it gets coated with"},{"t":138.7,"txt":"slag or flux, and you have to break that"},{"t":141,"txt":"off with your glove or sometimes even a"},{"t":142.8,"txt":"file or hit it on your workpiece. Now,"},{"t":145.3,"txt":"to strike an arc, you can either tap or"},{"t":147.3,"txt":"strike like a match. The lighter you do"},{"t":149.4,"txt":"it, the better from my experience. If"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"you just barely touch it to make a"},{"t":153.5,"txt":"spark, it's much less likely to stick."},{"t":156,"txt":"Most people stick because they're"},{"t":157.7,"txt":"hitting it a little bit too hard. Now,"},{"t":159.9,"txt":"when I go to actually strike my arc,"},{"t":162.8,"txt":"I'll just start it lightly like I'd"},{"t":165.8,"txt":"showed and then quickly get right into"},{"t":169.2,"txt":"the run of the weld holding a really"},{"t":171.5,"txt":"short arc length. And that brings us to"},{"t":173.9,"txt":"the next step in the process, and that"},{"t":176,"txt":"is running a bead. Now, when you're"},{"t":178.2,"txt":"running a bead, there are really three"},{"t":180.5,"txt":"things to pay attention to that make all"},{"t":182.6,"txt":"the difference. First one is your arc"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"length. This is a big deal. You need to"},{"t":186.7,"txt":"keep it really short. Notice how that"},{"t":188.6,"txt":"flux, it's just barely above the"},{"t":192.1,"txt":"material. Now, I'm also holding a"},{"t":194.3,"txt":"consistent angle. Notice it's pointed"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"backwards just a little bit to push some"},{"t":198.4,"txt":"of that slag um or melted flux back"},{"t":201.4,"txt":"behind the material. And the third thing"},{"t":204.6,"txt":"is my travel speed because the travel"},{"t":206.9,"txt":"speed is going to control the width or"},{"t":209.8,"txt":"size of your bead. So, you watch your"},{"t":212.2,"txt":"weld puddle and if you need a bigger"},{"t":214.5,"txt":"weld, you can slow down. If you need a"},{"t":216.5,"txt":"smaller one, you can speed up. So, if"},{"t":217.8,"txt":"you're getting inconsistent results,"},{"t":219.5,"txt":"that's why. Notice when I stop, I flick"},{"t":222.5,"txt":"the end of the rod and that little bit"},{"t":224.5,"txt":"of slag comes off the end. That's going"},{"t":226.5,"txt":"to make it easier to restart. So, I'm"},{"t":228.8,"txt":"shown that a few times. Now, the next"},{"t":231.5,"txt":"step is a restart. You often need to"},{"t":233.9,"txt":"stop partially through a bead because"},{"t":236.3,"txt":"either your electrode runs out or you"},{"t":238.4,"txt":"get in a bind or some other reason. And"},{"t":240.6,"txt":"so, it's important to know how to"},{"t":241.9,"txt":"restart. So, even though I flicked the"},{"t":244.4,"txt":"slag off, there's still a little bit of"},{"t":245.9,"txt":"flux that I need to chip off with my"},{"t":247.6,"txt":"glove. And I got a little extra here."},{"t":249.8,"txt":"So, there is some risk of paracity on"},{"t":252.3,"txt":"the start. So, if I absolutely can't"},{"t":254.4,"txt":"have that, I should use a new rod. But,"},{"t":256.2,"txt":"in this case, I think it'll be fine. I"},{"t":258.6,"txt":"start up ahead of the end of uh my weld"},{"t":261.7,"txt":"or that crater and loop back into it."},{"t":265.1,"txt":"See, when I start ahead of it, then I'll"},{"t":267.7,"txt":"be welding over and kind of cleaning up"},{"t":269.8,"txt":"any mess that I make with it, and I"},{"t":271.6,"txt":"won't leave any arc strikes, and I'm"},{"t":273.9,"txt":"back into the run of my bead exactly"},{"t":277,"txt":"like I was before. Now, when I stop at"},{"t":280.6,"txt":"the end of the bead, I'm going to do"},{"t":282.7,"txt":"something different than I would if I"},{"t":285,"txt":"know I'm going to have a restart. What"},{"t":286.7,"txt":"I'm going to do in this case is I'll"},{"t":288.2,"txt":"actually pause my travel here and feed a"},{"t":291,"txt":"little bit of rod in at the end to fill"},{"t":293.4,"txt":"the crater. So, watch. I'll stop moving"},{"t":295.8,"txt":"forward. Just feed in a little rod and"},{"t":298.3,"txt":"then flick that off to fill my crater."},{"t":301.8,"txt":"And here is that finished result. Notice"},{"t":304,"txt":"it's a little bit uh higher or I have a"},{"t":306.6,"txt":"little bit more reinforcement at the"},{"t":308.4,"txt":"restart. I do that on purpose because"},{"t":311.4,"txt":"that's a weak point and I'd rather have"},{"t":313.4,"txt":"a little bit more reinforcement. You"},{"t":315.5,"txt":"don't have to pause there to add that"},{"t":317.4,"txt":"much, but uh I I think it's a good uh"},{"t":320,"txt":"practice from a strength perspective."},{"t":323.1,"txt":"Now, that is the overall bead. Now, I"},{"t":325.1,"txt":"realized that I ran it over the mill"},{"t":327.6,"txt":"scale after I made that whole uh thing"},{"t":329.8,"txt":"about it's better without millc scale."},{"t":332,"txt":"You know, it works either way. Now, here"},{"t":333.8,"txt":"we're going to put it all together and"},{"t":335.4,"txt":"run a joint. So, when I'm working on a"},{"t":338,"txt":"Tjint, I start my weld there at the end,"},{"t":340.9,"txt":"and I need to pause to get my puddle"},{"t":343.4,"txt":"established, but not for too long before"},{"t":345.5,"txt":"I get moving. Now, I'm welding down into"},{"t":348.2,"txt":"that corner, which gives some extra arc"},{"t":349.9,"txt":"length. So, I'm just about scrubbing the"},{"t":352.4,"txt":"flux on the side. And after I stop, I'm"},{"t":356.1,"txt":"going to chip a little bit of slag right"},{"t":357.7,"txt":"out of that crater. And I'll do the same"},{"t":359.9,"txt":"thing for my restart where I'll strike"},{"t":362,"txt":"an arc up ahead of the weld, loop back"},{"t":365,"txt":"through, and then I'm off to the races"},{"t":368.2,"txt":"again. And I'm maintaining my arc"},{"t":370.1,"txt":"length, my electrode angle, and my"},{"t":373.6,"txt":"travel speed. Those are the three"},{"t":375,"txt":"variables that I'm paying attention to"},{"t":377,"txt":"here while I'm running a bead until I"},{"t":379.9,"txt":"get up to the end. And at the end, I'm"},{"t":382,"txt":"going to pause really uh briefly at the"},{"t":385,"txt":"end to build up a little extra material"},{"t":387.1,"txt":"in the crater and then flick that rod to"},{"t":390.6,"txt":"terminate the weld. And I can remove"},{"t":393,"txt":"some slag. And you see that we got"},{"t":394.9,"txt":"pretty much the same result. Let's clean"},{"t":396.5,"txt":"this off a little bit better with a wire"},{"t":398.2,"txt":"wheel. If you're new here, um be sure to"},{"t":401.6,"txt":"wear eye protection with this. of all"},{"t":403.4,"txt":"the tools, those little wires coming out"},{"t":405.2,"txt":"can be the worst. But, uh, we got a good"},{"t":407.6,"txt":"sound weld that'll hold very, very"},{"t":410.1,"txt":"strong just by following those simple"},{"t":412.1,"txt":"steps. Now, if you really want to break"},{"t":414.6,"txt":"this down even more into some"},{"t":416.2,"txt":"fundamental practice exercises where I"},{"t":418.6,"txt":"walk you through step by step, I have"},{"t":420.2,"txt":"some affordable online courses linked in"},{"t":422.1,"txt":"the description below. 39 bucks a"},{"t":423.8,"txt":"course, and I'll walk through the whole"},{"t":426.1,"txt":"journey with you, and it'll save you a"},{"t":427.4,"txt":"ton of time. And if you enjoyed this or"},{"t":429.7,"txt":"learned something, let me know by"},{"t":430.8,"txt":"hitting that thumbs up below. We'll see"},{"t":432.5,"txt":"you next time."}],"words":[{"t":2.56,"w":"When"},{"t":2.8,"w":"you're"},{"t":2.96,"w":"running"},{"t":3.12,"w":"a"},{"t":3.28,"w":"stick"},{"t":3.52,"w":"weld,"},{"t":3.919,"w":"there's"},{"t":4.08,"w":"a"},{"t":4.24,"w":"whole"},{"t":4.4,"w":"lot"},{"t":4.56,"w":"to"},{"t":4.799,"w":"think"},{"t":4.88,"w":"about,"},{"t":5.12,"w":"but"},{"t":5.359,"w":"if"},{"t":5.52,"w":"you"},{"t":5.6,"w":"break"},{"t":5.839,"w":"it"},{"t":6.08,"w":"down"},{"t":6.4,"w":"into"},{"t":7.04,"w":"simple"},{"t":7.52,"w":"steps,"},{"t":8.4,"w":"it's"},{"t":8.72,"w":"really"},{"t":9.12,"w":"a"},{"t":9.36,"w":"lot"},{"t":9.519,"w":"more"},{"t":9.76,"w":"manageable."},{"t":10.88,"w":"Hey,"},{"t":11.2,"w":"welcome"},{"t":11.44,"w":"to"},{"t":11.599,"w":"the"},{"t":11.759,"w":"shop."},{"t":12.08,"w":"Today,"},{"t":12.24,"w":"I'm"},{"t":12.48,"w":"going"},{"t":12.48,"w":"to"},{"t":12.639,"w":"show"},{"t":12.719,"w":"you"},{"t":12.88,"w":"a"},{"t":13.04,"w":"video"},{"t":13.2,"w":"that"},{"t":13.44,"w":"I"},{"t":13.599,"w":"wish"},{"t":13.84,"w":"I"},{"t":14.08,"w":"had"},{"t":14.48,"w":"when"},{"t":14.88,"w":"I"},{"t":15.12,"w":"was"},{"t":15.28,"w":"getting"},{"t":15.519,"w":"started"},{"t":15.679,"w":"with"},{"t":15.92,"w":"stick"},{"t":16.16,"w":"welding,"},{"t":16.64,"w":"and"},{"t":16.88,"w":"that"},{"t":17.199,"w":"is"},{"t":17.68,"w":"breaking"},{"t":18.16,"w":"a"},{"t":18.48,"w":"bead"},{"t":18.88,"w":"down"},{"t":19.76,"w":"into"},{"t":20.48,"w":"five"},{"t":20.8,"w":"different"},{"t":21.119,"w":"steps"},{"t":21.68,"w":"and"},{"t":21.92,"w":"what"},{"t":22.16,"w":"are"},{"t":22.24,"w":"the"},{"t":22.4,"w":"things"},{"t":22.56,"w":"you"},{"t":22.72,"w":"need"},{"t":22.88,"w":"to"},{"t":23.039,"w":"think"},{"t":23.279,"w":"about"},{"t":23.68,"w":"uh"},{"t":23.84,"w":"as"},{"t":24,"w":"you"},{"t":24.24,"w":"work"},{"t":24.4,"w":"through"},{"t":24.64,"w":"those."},{"t":25.359,"w":"Now,"},{"t":25.68,"w":"this"},{"t":25.84,"w":"is"},{"t":26,"w":"the"},{"t":26.24,"w":"big"},{"t":26.64,"w":"picture"},{"t":27.039,"w":"video,"},{"t":27.519,"w":"so"},{"t":27.68,"w":"I"},{"t":27.84,"w":"won't"},{"t":28,"w":"go"},{"t":28.16,"w":"into"},{"t":28.4,"w":"all"},{"t":28.64,"w":"of"},{"t":28.8,"w":"the"},{"t":29.039,"w":"details"},{"t":29.519,"w":"of"},{"t":29.84,"w":"each"},{"t":30.08,"w":"of"},{"t":30.24,"w":"these"},{"t":30.48,"w":"different"},{"t":30.88,"w":"parts"},{"t":31.119,"w":"of"},{"t":31.199,"w":"the"},{"t":31.359,"w":"weld,"},{"t":31.679,"w":"but"},{"t":31.84,"w":"I"},{"t":32,"w":"have"},{"t":32.079,"w":"them"},{"t":32.239,"w":"in"},{"t":32.399,"w":"my"},{"t":32.64,"w":"online"},{"t":32.96,"w":"courses"},{"t":33.44,"w":"and"},{"t":33.76,"w":"hundreds"},{"t":34.079,"w":"of"},{"t":34.239,"w":"videos"},{"t":34.559,"w":"online."},{"t":35.36,"w":"Now,"},{"t":35.6,"w":"the"},{"t":35.84,"w":"first"},{"t":36,"w":"step"},{"t":36.32,"w":"is"},{"t":36.64,"w":"your"},{"t":37.04,"w":"setup."},{"t":37.76,"w":"And"},{"t":38.16,"w":"I'm"},{"t":38.399,"w":"going"},{"t":38.559,"w":"to"},{"t":38.719,"w":"select"},{"t":39.04,"w":"my"},{"t":39.36,"w":"electrode"},{"t":39.92,"w":"based"},{"t":40.16,"w":"on"},{"t":40.32,"w":"this"},{"t":40.559,"w":"1/4"},{"t":40.879,"w":"in"},{"t":41.2,"w":"thick"},{"t":41.52,"w":"plate"},{"t":41.84,"w":"that"},{"t":42,"w":"I'll"},{"t":42.16,"w":"be"},{"t":42.32,"w":"welding."},{"t":42.96,"w":"And"},{"t":43.12,"w":"so,"},{"t":43.28,"w":"I'll"},{"t":43.44,"w":"use"},{"t":43.6,"w":"a"},{"t":43.84,"w":"1/8"},{"t":44.32,"w":"in"},{"t":44.719,"w":"718."},{"t":45.44,"w":"If"},{"t":45.6,"w":"it's"},{"t":45.76,"w":"under"},{"t":46,"w":"a/4"},{"t":46.399,"w":"in,"},{"t":46.719,"w":"I"},{"t":46.879,"w":"use"},{"t":47.039,"w":"smaller"},{"t":47.36,"w":"than"},{"t":47.6,"w":"1/8."},{"t":48.16,"w":"If"},{"t":48.239,"w":"it's"},{"t":48.64,"w":"uh"},{"t":48.8,"w":"over,"},{"t":49.12,"w":"I"},{"t":49.36,"w":"pretty"},{"t":49.44,"w":"much"},{"t":49.6,"w":"use"},{"t":49.76,"w":"a"},{"t":49.84,"w":"1/8"},{"t":50.239,"w":"for"},{"t":50.48,"w":"everything."},{"t":50.719,"w":"And"},{"t":50.879,"w":"I'm"},{"t":51.039,"w":"using"},{"t":51.28,"w":"Lincoln"},{"t":51.84,"w":"Excalibur"},{"t":52.48,"w":"718s."},{"t":53.36,"w":"They're"},{"t":53.52,"w":"my"},{"t":53.76,"w":"favorite."},{"t":54.559,"w":"There's"},{"t":54.879,"w":"some"},{"t":55.039,"w":"light"},{"t":55.28,"w":"mill"},{"t":55.6,"w":"scale"},{"t":56,"w":"on"},{"t":56.32,"w":"this"},{"t":56.64,"w":"material"},{"t":57.52,"w":"and"},{"t":57.84,"w":"these"},{"t":58.16,"w":"strip"},{"t":58.48,"w":"discs"},{"t":58.879,"w":"can"},{"t":59.039,"w":"clean"},{"t":59.28,"w":"it"},{"t":59.44,"w":"off."},{"t":59.68,"w":"Now,"},{"t":59.92,"w":"you"},{